# UI-map reachability smoke test (ledger item emu-ui-map).
#
# Drives EVERY edge in testing-assets/emu/ui-map.toml against the live emu: for
# each edge the runner resets to the boot node, paths to the edge's `from` node
# via the map, applies the edge gesture, then asserts BOTH the destination node's
# `recognize` predicate AND that the edge's declared `arrival` @trace line was
# emitted. This makes the UI map itself behavior-diff-gated: a gesture, class, or
# route drift breaks this test.
#
# The core package gives the picker real contents (the unit_picker_dense edge).
!packages core

frames 20
!reachability
